Data construction.
Post-TTA inference.
The adapted checkpoint is loaded for inference with model overrides: { skip cross attn: false } to re-enable perturbation conditioning. DDP checkpoints (single .pt fi le) and FSDP checkpoints (sharded directory) are both supported transparently.

