Appendix A X-Cell Model Specification
A.7 Training Configuration
Batch size scaling.
scGPT pre-trained initialization.
X-Cell initializes gene embeddings from a pre-trained scGPT model [8]. The vocabulary is mapped via ENSEMBL ID and symbol matching: pre-trained embeddings are transferred to matching genes in the new vocabulary, with unmapped genes retaining random initialization. The pre-trained transformer layers (12 layers, d = 512) are also loaded with strict=False to accommodate architectural differences. This warm initialization provides a strong starting point for gene-gene co-expression patterns.

