FSDP2 configuration.
Fully Sharded Data Parallel (FSDP2) [94] with per-layer wrapping on three module types: ModernTransformerEncoderLayer , TransformerEncoderLayer , and CrossAttnBlock . This achieves 74% of parameters in per-layer sharding units and 26% in the root (embeddings, decoder). FULL_STATE_DICT is used for checkpoints.

